[en.IDEA_C01_ANGRY_SPY]
Anger Management

[en.IDEA_C01_ANGRY_SPY_desc]
It seems now that our enemies know we are always angry, the only way to catch them off guard is to learn to control our anger.
Therefore, as long as we can keep our cool, they will never realize they have been penetrated.

[zh.IDEA_C01_ANGRY_SPY]
情绪控制

[zh.IDEA_C01_ANGRY_SPY_desc]
现在看来，我们的敌人知道我们总是愤怒的，唯一能让他们猝不及防的方法就是学会控制我们的愤怒。
因此，只要我们能保持冷静，他们就永远不会意识到自己已经被渗透。
